Legacy overlayfs compatibility for Agent Substrate v1.0.0.

Base: b34fbee742906494b5eb4f1f36987176bf8770a4.
Adapted from Sam Huber's Linux 6.1 overlay fallback. Keep the incremental
mount API as the default and fall back only for unsupported API operations.
Bound and validate legacy options; retain both errors when fallback fails.
The consumer is the worker image, which must be rebuilt from this source.

